1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,360
Locked me in an aquarium? Adorable.

2
00:00:04,360 --> 00:00:11,950
No bones. Only a beak. If it fits, I fit.

3
00:00:11,950 --> 00:00:17,250
A crack in a lid? Door. A drain pipe? Highway.

4
00:00:17,250 --> 00:00:25,580
Inky the octopus escaped his tank and slid into the sea.

5
00:00:25,580 --> 00:00:29,120
Goodbye, humans. Thanks for the snacks.
